<section id="about" class="portfolio-section about-section">
  <div class="reading-width">
    <% if (title == 'Home') { %>
      <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
    <% } else { %>
      <h1>About Me</h1>
    <% } %>
    <p>My studies in Networking and IT Security at Ontario Tech University involve learning how devices communicate and how computer systems can be protected. I'm interested in understanding how these connections work.</p>
    <p>In my free time, I enjoy drawing and painting. I've experimented with watercolour, acrylic paint, pencil, and pen, using subjects such as everyday objects, buildings, and landscapes.</p>
    <p>I also have an interest in content creation and make short-form Instagram content geared towards university students. This portfolio gives me a place to share what I've made as I continue learning.</p>
  </div>
</section>
